# 高频词汇 List01
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List01核心词汇

{{economy}}{/ɪˈkɒnəmi/}{经济；节约}{The economy has shown signs of recovery this year.}
{{efficient}}{/ɪˈfɪʃnt/}{高效的；有效率的}{We need a more efficient way to process data.}
{{establish}}{/ɪˈstæblɪʃ/}{建立；设立}{The company was established in 1990.}
{{evaluate}}{/ɪˈvæljueɪt/}{评估；评价}{Teachers need to evaluate students' performance regularly.}
{{evidence}}{/ˈevɪdəns/}{证据；迹象}{There is strong evidence to support this theory.}}
{{evolve}}{/ɪˈvɒlv/}{进化；发展}{Technology continues to evolve at a rapid pace.}
{{exceed}}{/ɪkˈsiːd/}{超过；超出}{Sales exceeded expectations this quarter.}
{{exclude}}{/ɪkˈskluːd/}{排除；排斥}{The study excluded patients under 18.}
{{execute}}{/ˈeksɪkjuːt/}{执行；实施}{The plan was executed flawlessly.}
{{exhibit}}{/ɪɡˈzɪbɪt/}{展览；展示}{The museum exhibits rare artifacts from ancient Egypt.}
{{expand}}{/ɪkˈspænd/}{扩展；膨胀}{The company plans to expand into Asian markets.}
{{explicit}}{/ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/}{明确的；直言的}{The instructions were explicit and easy to follow.}
{{exploit}}{/ɪkˈsplɔɪt/}{开发；剥削}{We must exploit every opportunity to grow.}}
{{expose}}{/ɪkˈspəʊz/}{暴露；揭露}{The scandal was exposed by the media.}}
{{extend}}{/ɪkˈstend/}{延伸；扩展}{The deadline has been extended by one week.}
{{external}}{/ɪkˈstɜːnl/}{外部的；外面的}{External factors can influence the outcome.}}
{{facilitate}}{/fəˈsɪlɪteɪt/}{促进；使便利}{Technology can facilitate communication between teams.}
{{factor}}{/ˈfæktər/}{因素；因子}{Several factors contributed to the decline.}}
{{feature}}{/ˈfiːtʃər/}{特征；特色}{The new phone has many impressive features.}
{{finance}}{/ˈfaɪnæns/}{金融；财政}{She works in the finance department.}
{{flexible}}{/ˈfleksəbl/}{灵活的；可弯曲的}{We need a more flexible approach to this problem.}
{{focus}}{/ˈfəʊkəs/}{焦点；集中}{We should focus on the most important tasks first.}
{{formula}}{/ˈfɔːmjələ/}{公式；配方}{The scientist developed a new formula for the experiment.}}
{{foundation}}{/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/}{基础；基金会}{Education is the foundation of a successful career.}
{{framework}}{/ˈfreɪmwɜːk/}{框架；结构}{We need a clear framework for the project.}
{{function}}{/ˈfʌŋkʃn/}{功能；函数}{What is the function of this protein?}
{{fundamental}}{/ˌfʌndəˈmentl/}{基本的；根本的}{This is a fundamental principle of economics.}
{{generate}}{/ˈdʒenəreɪt/}{产生；发生}{Solar panels generate electricity from sunlight.}
{{global}}{/ˈɡləʊbl/}{全球的；全面的}{Climate change is a global issue.}
{{guarantee}}{/ˌɡærənˈtiː/}{保证；担保}{We guarantee the quality of our products.}
